## 3. `ParentPortal.vue` — form and API

Template (name + phone):

```21:46:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/ParentPortal.vue
      <div class="pp-login-form">
        <div class="pp-field">
          <label>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined pp-field-icon">person</span>
            學生姓名
